============================================================

JarvisOS Environment Configuration

============================================================

IMPORTANT:

- Is file me apni real API keys/passwords hi add karein.

- Is file ko GitHub par public upload MAT karein.

- .gitignore me .env already ignore hona chahiye.

============================================================

============================================================

APPLICATION

============================================================

JARVIS_APP_NAME=JarvisOS
JARVIS_VERSION=1.0.0
JARVIS_DEBUG=false

============================================================

AI PROVIDER

============================================================

Options:

auto

openai

gemini

claude

AI_PROVIDER=auto

Agar blank rakhen to provider ka default model use hoga.

AI_MODEL=

============================================================

OPENAI

============================================================

OPENAI_API_KEY=
OPENAI_MODEL=

============================================================

GOOGLE GEMINI

============================================================

GEMINI_API_KEY=
GEMINI_MODEL=

============================================================

ANTHROPIC CLAUDE

============================================================

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
CLAUDE_MODEL=

============================================================

VOICE - SPEECH TO TEXT

============================================================

auto

en

hi

hinglish

JARVIS_VOICE_LANGUAGE=auto

JARVIS_STT_TIMEOUT=5
JARVIS_STT_PHRASE_TIME_LIMIT=12
JARVIS_STT_ENERGY_THRESHOLD=300
JARVIS_STT_DYNAMIC_ENERGY=true

============================================================

TEXT TO SPEECH

============================================================

JARVIS_TTS_RATE=175
JARVIS_TTS_VOLUME=1.0

Optional:

JARVIS_TTS_VOICE=

============================================================

WAKE WORD

============================================================

Picovoice AccessKey required for Porcupine.

PICOVOICE_ACCESS_KEY=

Example:

jarvis

mira

Actual keyword availability depends on the Porcupine

keyword model configured for the application.

JARVIS_WAKEWORD_KEYWORD=jarvis
JARVIS_WAKEWORD_SENSITIVITY=0.55
JARVIS_WAKEWORD_ENABLED=true

============================================================

MEMORY

============================================================

JARVIS_MEMORY_ENABLED=true
JARVIS_MEMORY_MAX_SHORT_TERM=20

============================================================

SECURITY

============================================================

Dangerous operations require confirmation.

JARVIS_REQUIRE_CONFIRMATION=true

============================================================

WEB

============================================================

JARVIS_WEB_ENABLED=true

JARVIS_WEB_SEARCH_PROVIDER=duckduckgo
JARVIS_WEB_TIMEOUT=15
JARVIS_WEB_MAX_RESULTS=10

============================================================

VISION

============================================================

JARVIS_VISION_ENABLED=true

Optional Tesseract executable.

Example Windows path:

JARVIS_TESSERACT_PATH=C:\Program Files\Tesseract-OCR\tesseract.exe

JARVIS_TESSERACT_PATH=

============================================================

ANDROID / ADB

============================================================

Optional custom ADB executable.

JARVIS_ADB_PATH=

============================================================

EMAIL

============================================================

JARVIS_EMAIL_ADDRESS=
JARVIS_EMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=

JARVIS_SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
JARVIS_SMTP_PORT=587

JARVIS_IMAP_HOST=imap.gmail.com
JARVIS_IMAP_PORT=993

JARVIS_EMAIL_USE_TLS=true
JARVIS_EMAIL_TIMEOUT=20
JARVIS_EMAIL_MAX_ATTACHMENT_MB=20

============================================================

WHATSAPP

============================================================

JARVIS_WHATSAPP_PROFILE=data/whatsapp_profile
JARVIS_WHATSAPP_BROWSER=chrome
JARVIS_WHATSAPP_TIMEOUT=30
JARVIS_WHATSAPP_HEADLESS=false

============================================================

TELEGRAM

============================================================

JARVIS_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
JARVIS_TELEGRAM_DEFAULT_CHAT_ID=

JARVIS_TELEGRAM_API_BASE=https://api.telegram.org
JARVIS_TELEGRAM_TIMEOUT=20
JARVIS_TELEGRAM_MAX_FILE_MB=20

============================================================

SMS

============================================================

Generic REST SMS provider.

Configure these according to your actual SMS provider.

JARVIS_SMS_API_URL=
JARVIS_SMS_API_KEY=
JARVIS_SMS_SENDER=

JARVIS_SMS_TIMEOUT=20
JARVIS_SMS_MAX_MESSAGE_LENGTH=1600

============================================================

PLUGINS

============================================================

Leave blank unless you have your own marketplace server.

JARVIS_PLUGIN_MARKETPLACE_URL=

============================================================

UPDATES

============================================================

JARVIS_UPDATE_URL=
JARVIS_UPDATE_MANIFEST_URL=
JARVIS_UPDATE_DIR=data/updates
JARVIS_UPDATE_TIMEOUT=30

============================================================

UI

============================================================

JARVIS_UI_THEME=dark

============================================================

LOGGING

============================================================

JARVIS_LOG_LEVEL=INFO

============================================================

LICENSE

============================================================

JARVIS_LICENSE_FILE=data/license.json

Optional RSA public key or public-key file.

JARVIS_LICENSE_PUBLIC_KEY=

JARVIS_LICENSE_PUBLIC_KEY_FILE=

============================================================

GENERAL

============================================================

User-facing confirmation behavior.

JARVIS_CONFIRM_DANGEROUS_ACTIONS=true